{"type":"Film","id":"HU2015_003","slug":"hu2015-003-argo-2","title":{"native":"Argo 2","english":"Argo 2"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-04-30","year":2015},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Attila Árpa","slug":"attila-arpa","name":"Attila Árpa","birthYear":1971,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Hungary","awards":[]}],"genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3117504/mediaviewer/rm3858359296/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OjCKjhKtRnE&ab_channel=NemzetiFilmint%C3%A9zet"},"synopsis":{"native":"Balog Tibi (Kovács Lajos) és bandája (Scherer Péter, Bicskey Lukács, Kiss József) tíz év után sem lett okosabb. Továbbra is pitiáner, suttyó bűnözők, akik nagymenőknek hiszik magukat és a nagy lóvéra vágynak. Egy japán szindikátus árnyékembere (Kulka János) balszerencséjére pont Tibiéket bízza meg egy felbecsülhetetlen értékű adathordozó megszerzésével. Tibiék vajmi keveset értenek az IT világához, ezért egy számítástechnika tanárt (Bán János) visznek magukkal a lehetetlennek tűnő műveletre. A bajt a roma maffia feje (Nagypál Gábor) fokozza, aki egy régi ügy miatt elégtételt akar venni Tibin. A hajsza során Tibiék mindezeken túl japán bérgyilkosokat és a szlovák hadsereget is magukra haragítják, így az esélyük arra, hogy a nagy zsével Malibu tengerpartjára szökjenek, radikálisan csökken. De aki Tibit alábecsüli, annak annyi. Mert Tibi megoldja okosban.","english":"Hungarian small time crook, 70 year old Tibi Balog gets out of prison after 10 years, but he didn't change a bit. When a Japanese crime syndicate hires him to acquire a Hungarian invention - the world's first floppy disc - Tibi puts his band of retarded thugs back together and the action starts. As expected, Tibi completely screws up the job and becomes the target of Japanese Assassins, a very angry Gypsie family and the entire Slovakian Army. Gags and action and no political correctness at all. The Hungarian heat is on."},"production":[{"country":"Hungary","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"HU2015_003_01","film":"HU2015_003","person":{"id":"Lajos Kovács","slug":"lajos-kovacs","name":"Lajos Kovács","birthYear":1944,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Hungary","awards":[]},"age":"3: Third Age (60-75)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"Central European","class":"Lower class","profession":"Employed","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"}],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Attila Árpa","slug":"attila-arpa","name":"Attila Árpa","birthYear":1971,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Hungary","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Feró Nagy","slug":"fero-nagy","name":"Feró Nagy","birthYear":1946,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Hungary","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Imre Csuja","slug":"imre-csuja","name":"Imre Csuja","birthYear":1960,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Hungary","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"János Bán","slug":"janos-ban","name":"János Bán","birthYear":1955,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Hungary","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"hu2015-002-liza-a-rokatunder","title":{"native":"Liza, a rókatündér"}},"year":2016,"award":"Magyar Mozgókép Díj (2016-2023)","category":"Best Supporting Actor","result":"Nominated"}]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"János Kulka","slug":"janos-kulka","name":"János Kulka","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Hungary","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"hu2016-009-felvilag","title":{"native":"Félvilág"}},"year":2016,"award":"Magyar Mozgókép Díj (2016-2023)","category":"Best Supporting Actor","result":"Awarded"},{"film":{"slug":"hu2022-007-a-jatszma","title":{"native":"A játszma"}},"year":2022,"award":"Magyar Mozgókép Díj (2016-2023)","category":"Best A